### ============================================================
### jsonplaceholder.typicode.com - HTTP 请求示例集合
### 覆盖 GET / POST / PUT / PATCH / DELETE 等方法
### 可在 VS Code REST Client、IntelliJ HTTP Client 等工具中直接执行
### ============================================================

@base = https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com

### ---------- 1. GET - 获取资源列表 ----------

# 获取所有文章
GET {{base}}/posts

###

# 获取列表并携带查询参数(过滤 + 排序 + 分页)
GET {{base}}/posts?userId=1&_limit=5&_sort=id&_order=desc

###

# 获取单个资源
GET {{base}}/posts/1

###

### ---------- 2. GET - 嵌套子资源 ----------

# 获取某篇文章的所有评论
GET {{base}}/posts/1/comments

###

# 获取某个相册的所有照片
GET {{base}}/albums/1/photos

###

# 组合查询: 用户的待办事项
GET {{base}}/todos?userId=1&_limit=10

###

### ---------- 3. POST - 创建资源 ----------

# 新建文章 (返回 201, body 中带上新分配的 id)
POST {{base}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hello REST Client",
  "body": "This is a test post created via test.http",
  "userId": 1
}

###

# 新建用户
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "address": {
    "street": "Simplify Street 123",
    "suite": "Apt 101",
    "city": "Gwenborough",
    "zipcode": "92998-3874",
    "geo": {
      "lat": "-37.3159",
      "lng": "81.1496"
    }
  },
  "phone": "010-778520",
  "website": "example.com",
  "company": {
    "name": "Hilbert Inc",
    "catchPhrase": "Multi-layered client-server neural-net",
    "bs": "harness real-time e-markets"
  }
}

###

### ---------- 4. PUT - 全量更新资源 ----------

# 完整替换文章 1 (需提供所有字段)
PUT {{base}}/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Updated Title (PUT full replace)",
  "body": "Updated body content replacing the original one.",
  "userId": 1
}

###

# 完整替换待办事项 1
PUT {{base}}/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Updated todo title",
  "completed": true,
  "userId": 1
}

###

### ---------- 5. PATCH - 部分更新资源 ----------

# 仅修改文章 1 的标题
PATCH {{base}}/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Patched Title Only"
}

###

# 仅将评论 1 标记为已完成状态字段
PATCH {{base}}/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Patched comment name",
  "email": "patched@example.com"
}

###

### ---------- 6. DELETE - 删除资源 ----------

# 删除文章 1 (该 API 为模拟数据, 返回 200 与空对象)
DELETE {{base}}/posts/1

###

# 删除相册 1
DELETE {{base}}/albums/1

###

### ---------- 7. 其他方法 / 边界情况 ----------

# HEAD - 仅获取响应头 (验证资源是否存在)
HEAD {{base}}/posts/1

###

# OPTIONS - 查询服务器支持的跨域方法
OPTIONS {{base}}/posts

###

# GET 不存在的资源 -> 预期 404
GET {{base}}/posts/999

###

# POST 到不存在的资源路径 -> 预期 404
POST {{base}}/invalid-resource
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "foo": "bar"
}

###
